msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:208
msgid ""
"**直觉**：参数量小不等于计算量小。一个 $1 \\times 1$ 卷积参数很少，但如果特征图很大（$1024 \\times "
"1024$），FLOPs 依然很高。计算量的公式是："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:210
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\text{FLOPs} = K_h \\cdot K_w \\cdot C_{in} \\cdot C_{out} \\cdot "
"H_{out} \\cdot W_{out}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:212
msgid "**关键观察**：空间和通道混在一起计算。能不能分拆？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:214
msgid "深度可分离卷积：空间与通道分离"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:216
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"深度可分离卷积（Depthwise Separable Convolution，MobileNet "
"核心{cite}`howard2017mobilenets`）的洞察：**把空间和通道分开处理**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:250
msgid "**两步拆分**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:252
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Depthwise**：$K \\times K$ 卷积，但每个通道独立处理（不跨通道）——计算量 $K^2 \\cdot C_{in} "
"\\cdot H \\cdot W$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:253
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Pointwise**：$1 \\times 1$ 卷积，只在通道间融合——计算量 $C_{in} \\cdot C_{out} \\cdot"
" H \\cdot W$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:255
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"普通卷积计算量：$K^2 \\cdot C_{in} \\cdot C_{out} \\cdot H \\cdot W$ "
"分离卷积计算量：$(K^2 \\cdot C_{in} + C_{in} \\cdot C_{out}) \\cdot H \\cdot W$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:258
msgid "**计算量减少倍数** $= \\dfrac{K^2 \\cdot C_{out}}{K^2 + C_{out}}$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:260
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"当 $C_{out} = 256$, $K=3$ 时，$\\dfrac{9 \\times 256}{9 + 256} \\approx "
"8.7$，约减少 **8.7 倍**计算量（参数量也减少相同倍数）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:262
msgid "分组卷积：分离度的调节旋钮"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:264
