#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:407
msgid ""
"**直觉**：前两个维度关心\"算多少\"。但还有一个隐藏的杀手：**计算能不能并行**？如果 forward 函数里有 Python 的 "
"`for` 循环和 `if/else` 分支，那么即使每个操作很快，整体速度也会被串行依赖拖垮。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:409
msgid ""
"**关键问题**：两个模型 FLOPs 完全相同，一个用 Python `for` 循环逐时间步计算，一个用全张量运算——前者可能慢 100 "
"倍。为什么？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:411
msgid "问题：Python 控制流的三重代价"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:413
msgid "在 forward 里写 Python `for` 循环或 `if/else` 分支，看似方便，实则付出三重代价："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:415
msgid ""
"# ❌ 看似正常，实则低效\n"
"class SlowRNN(nn.Module):\n"
"    def forward(self, x):\n"
"        # x: (batch, seq_len, hidden)\n"
"        outputs = []\n"
"        h = torch.zeros(x.size(0), self.hidden_size)\n"
"        for t in range(x.size(1)):          # ① 串行依赖：第 t 步必须等 t-1 步\n"
"            xt = x[:, t, :]                  # ② 每次取一个切片，无法融合\n"
"            if h.sum() > 0:                  # ③ 动态分支，阻止图优化\n"
"                h = torch.tanh(self.w_ih(xt) + self.w_hh(h))\n"
"            else:\n"
"                h = torch.tanh(self.w_ih(xt))\n"
"            outputs.append(h)\n"
"        return torch.stack(outputs, dim=1)   # stack 操作又引入一次内存搬运\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:432
msgid "三重代价分别是："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:434
msgid ""
"**代价一：串行依赖（Sequential Dependency）**。循环体内的每一轮必须等上一轮结束。GPU 有上千个核心，但 `for t "
"in range(seq_len)` 强行让这些核心排队——`t=0` 算完才能算 `t=1`。当 $seq\\_len=1000$ 时，意味着 "
"999 个时间步在空转等待。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:436
msgid ""
"**代价二：阻止计算图编译（No Graph Optimization）**。PyTorch 是动态图框架，每一步的 Python "
"控制流都会创建一个新的计算图节点。`torch.compile` 和 `torch.jit.script` 尝试将 Python "
"代码编译为优化的静态图，但 `if` 和 `for` 让编译器\"看不懂\"完整的计算模式，无法做算子融合和内存规划。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:438
msgid ""
"**代价三：内核启动开销（Kernel Launch Overhead）**。每个 PyTorch 操作（如 "
"`self.w_ih(xt)`）都涉及一次 GPU 内核（kernel）启动。当循环体里有 3 个操作、循环 1000 次时，就是 3000 "
"次内核启动。每次启动的延迟约为 5-10μs——仅仅启动开销就累计了 15-30ms，而实际计算可能只需 5ms。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:440
msgid "策略一：向量化——用张量运算代替循环"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:442
msgid "最直接的解法：**把\"逐个处理\"变成\"整批处理\"**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:444
msgid ""
"# ✅ 向量化：一次处理整个序列\n"
"class FastRNN(nn.Module):\n"
"    def forward(self, x):\n"
"        # x: (batch, seq_len, hidden)\n"
"        batch, seq_len, hidden = x.shape\n"
"        h = torch.zeros(batch, hidden, device=x.device)\n"
"        outputs = []\n"
"        for t in range(seq_len):\n"
"            h = torch.tanh(x[:, t, :] @ self.w_ih.T + h @ self.w_hh.T)\n"
"            outputs.append(h)\n"
"        return torch.stack(outputs, dim=1)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:458
msgid "但 RNN 的串行本质无法完全消除——只能缓解。真正从架构层面解决这个问题的是 Transformer。"
msgstr ""

