msgid "逐元素加法 $4096 \\times 4096$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:530
msgid "0.016 GFLOPs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:530
msgid "**0.16**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:562
msgid ""
"矩阵乘法的算术强度是 687——计算量远大于数据搬运量，受限于**计算能力**（Compute-Bound）。 逐元素加法的算术强度只有 "
"0.16——数据搬运量远大于计算量，受限于**内存带宽**（Memory-Bound）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:565
msgid ""
"**DW 卷积的尴尬**：DW 卷积虽然 FLOPs 低，但算术强度也低——$3 \\times 3$ 的卷积核只做 9 次乘法，却要读取 9 "
"个输入值和 1 个输出值。加上每个通道独立，无法组成大矩阵乘法。这就是为什么 DW 卷积\"理论快 8 倍，实际可能只快 2-3 倍\"。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:567
msgid "策略一：算子融合——减少\"往返搬运\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:569
msgid "深度学习中最常见的算子序列是 `Conv → BN → ReLU`。朴素实现需要三次内核启动和三次内存读写："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:571
msgid ""
"# ❌ 三次内核启动，两次中间结果的内存读写\n"
"x = self.conv(x)    # 写中间结果到内存\n"
"x = self.bn(x)      # 读中间结果，写中间结果\n"
"x = F.relu(x)       # 读中间结果，写最终结果\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:578
msgid "算子融合将这三个操作合并为一次内核调用："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:607
msgid ""
"融合后，中间结果不再写回内存——在 GPU 寄存器或共享内存中直接传递。这正是 `torch.compile` "
"和推理框架（TensorRT、ONNX Runtime）的核心优化之一。"
msgstr ""

