#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:662
msgid "混合精度的核心做法：**前向和反向传播用 FP16/BF16 计算（快），权重更新用 FP32 累积（稳）**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:664
msgid ""
"# PyTorch 混合精度训练的标准写法\n"
"from torch.cuda.amp import autocast, GradScaler\n"
"\n"
"scaler = GradScaler()\n"
"\n"
"for data, target in dataloader:\n"
"    optimizer.zero_grad()\n"
"    \n"
"    with autocast():                    # 前向：自动用 FP16 计算\n"
"        output = model(data)\n"
"        loss = criterion(output, target)\n"
"    \n"
"    scaler.scale(loss).backward()       # 反向：scale 防止梯度下溢\n"
"    scaler.step(optimizer)             # 更新：FP32 精度累加\n"
"    scaler.update()\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:682
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`GradScaler` 的作用：FP16 的数值范围远小于 FP32（$6 \\times 10^{-8} \\sim 65,504$ vs "
"$1.4 \\times 10^{-45} \\sim 3.4 \\times 10^{38}$）。微小梯度在 FP16 下可能变成 "
"0（下溢）。scaler 将 loss 放大若干倍，让梯度也放大，反向传播后再缩小回来——避免下溢的同时保持精度。"
msgstr ""

