msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:794
msgid "MobileNetV2 论文明确建议在最后的 Bottleneck 用线性激活（Linear Bottleneck）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:796
msgid "**教训**：**倒残差的最后必须是线性激活**。这是 MobileNetV2 的关键设计，不能省略。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:798
msgid "案例五：Python 循环里的张量拼接"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:800
msgid "**场景**：为了处理变长序列，你用 Python 循环逐个样本做 padding 和拼接："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:802
msgid ""
"# ❌ Python 循环 + 逐个 cat\n"
"outputs = []\n"
"for x in batch:\n"
"    h = model(x)                # 每个样本单独 forward\n"
"    outputs.append(h)\n"
"result = torch.cat(outputs)     # 最后拼接\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:813
msgid "训练速度只有预期的 5-10%"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:814
msgid "GPU 利用率徘徊在 20-30%"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:818
msgid "每个样本单独 forward 意味着 $batch\\_size$ 次内核启动（而不是 1 次）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:819
msgid "`torch.cat` 又触发一次内存重分配和拷贝"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:820
msgid "GPU 被\"碎片化\"的小任务填满，无法发挥并行优势"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:822
msgid ""
"**教训**：**尽量在 batch 维度上统一处理**。用 `pad_sequence` + `pack_padded_sequence`（或 "
"attention mask）在单次 forward 中处理整个 batch。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:824
msgid "案例六：DW 卷积搭配小特征图"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:826
msgid "**场景**：你在 MobileNetV2 的深层（特征图只有 $7 \\times 7$）大量使用 DW 卷积。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:830
msgid "实际速度只有理论速度的 30%"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:831
msgid "换成标准卷积后反而更快"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:835
#, python-brace-format
msgid "DW 卷积的算术强度极低（见{ref}`efficiency-hardware`）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:836
msgid "当特征图很小时，DW 卷积受限于内核启动开销和内存带宽，GPU 的并行能力完全浪费"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:837
msgid "标准卷积虽然 FLOPs 更高，但能组成大矩阵乘法，硬件利用率高"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:839
msgid "**教训**：**深层小特征图考虑换回标准卷积**。DW 卷积在特征图 $\\geq 14 \\times 14$ 时才最有效。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:841
msgid "决策树：效率优化策略选择"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:877
msgid "**核心原则**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:879
msgid "效率优化是**权衡**，不是\"免费午餐\"——每个维度都有代价"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:880
msgid "**先 profile，再优化**——不要猜瓶颈在哪，用数据说话"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:881
msgid "先确定 baseline 能正常工作，再逐步优化"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:882
msgid "每次优化后都要验证准确率，别只盯着模型大小和速度"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:883
msgid "四个维度可以叠加使用，但每次只加一个，测量效果后再加下一个"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:885
msgid "信息论视角：效率优化为什么可能"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:887
msgid "效率优化能成功的根本原因来自信息论：**自然数据（图像、文本、语音）的特征具有稀疏性和低维结构**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:889
msgid ""
"通道之间不是独立的——256 个通道中，很多通道捕捉的是高度相关的信息。1×1 卷积能发现这种相关性，将 256 维压缩到 64 "
"维，保留的信息量基本相同。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:891
msgid "同样，空间和通道的**可分离性**意味着：空间模式（边缘、纹理）和通道模式（哪种特征）的交互不是任意组合的——把它们分开处理，信息损失很小。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:893
#, python-brace-format
msgid "用{ref}`mutual-information`的语言说："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:895
msgid "Bottleneck 做了 $I(X;Z) \\approx I(X;Y)$ 的信息压缩——压缩后信息几乎不变"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:896
msgid ""
"DW 卷积利用了 $I_{\\text{space}, \\text{channel}} \\approx I_{\\text{space}} +"
" I_{\\text{channel}}$ 的近似分离性"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:897
msgid "混合精度利用了\"位数的冗余\"——大多数梯度值和权重值不需要 32 位精度来表达"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:898
msgid "算子融合利用了\"计算的局部性\"——相邻操作之间的数据不需要写回全局内存"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:900
msgid "这就是为什么我们能\"白嫖\"效率——压缩掉的是冗余，保留的是信息。而控制流优化和硬件感知算法更进一步：它们压缩的是**时间维度**的冗余（消除不必要的等待）和**空间局部性**的浪费（数据尽量留在高速缓存中）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part5-efficiency.md:904
#, python-brace-format
msgid "四件装备齐了。但面对一座具体的山，先动哪件？{doc}`part6-diagnosis`——登山者的自救手册。"
msgstr ""

